Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- pauses.py: no shot under 0.8 s inside a take; merge_short() joins a short shot to a <= 0.35 s neighbour when the
  join is silent on the lav (#2's "If" alone in 0.44 s at 1:25, and the same in #7/#10/#16); air after lines 0.12 s
- check.py fails a short shot next to a tiny pause and any "?" in a title; hook_font sans|serif (Playfair 800 with
  lining figures, titles only) — serif on #2, #6, #12, #14
- #10: the lone "So," cut (words + chunks updated); #14: limiter margin for AAC overshoot (limit_margin_db 2.0)
- All 9 re-rendered: #2 v8, #6 v10, #7 v11, #9 v8, #10 v7, #12 v6, #14 v5, #16 v6, #17 v14 — QA ALL PASS +
  stutters PASS, previews on Telegram, not yet in Drive Export

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
